1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,765
MIRA: I'm here. First floor.

2
00:00:01,895 --> 00:00:03,448
DEV: Me too. Window table.

3
00:00:03,578 --> 00:00:05,138
MIRA: I'm AT the window table.

4
00:00:05,388 --> 00:00:06,395
DEV: I'm waving!

5
00:00:06,395 --> 00:00:07,431
MIRA: So am I!

6
00:00:07,681 --> 00:00:08,980
DEV: The sign says one!

7
00:00:09,180 --> 00:00:10,905
MIRA: The front door is right here!

8
00:00:11,105 --> 00:00:12,369
MIRA: Oh! Upstairs!

9
00:00:12,369 --> 00:00:13,544
DEV: Oh! The entrance!

10
00:00:13,544 --> 00:00:14,960
MIRA: Stay there, I'm coming!
DEV: Stay there, I'm coming!

11
00:00:18,244 --> 00:00:19,903
DEV: Okay. I'm here.
MIRA: Okay. I'm here.

12
00:00:20,003 --> 00:00:20,818
MIRA: Where?

13
00:00:21,548 --> 00:00:23,288
That's an off-by-one error.

14
00:00:23,288 --> 00:00:25,998
Computers count from zero, people from one.

15
00:00:25,998 --> 00:00:28,818
One slip means a skipped item, or a crash.

16
00:00:29,218 --> 00:00:30,505
DEV: Coming up!
MIRA: Coming down!
